      "value": "B-LD - BACnet Lighting Device"
    },
    "productDescription": {
      "provenance": "user-entered",
      "value": "A BACnet/IP luminaire built on the CAS BACnet Stack. It presents one commandable Lighting Output whose level is driven by both a 16-slot Priority_Array and the constructed Lighting_Command SEQUENCE. Every operation of Table 12-67 is carried out over time - fades over their fade time, ramps at their ramp rate, warns wait out Egress_Time - with Tracking_Value, In_Progress and Egress_Active reporting it; the lamp and dimming driver are a labelled Simulation. Plus DeviceCommunicationControl and local TimeSynchronization. It answers ReadProperty and WriteProperty for every required property of every object, and is discoverable by Who-Is / I-Am and Who-Has / I-Have. It is a tutorial for implementers of the B-LD profile."
    },
    "productName": {
      "provenance": "user-entered",
      "value": "CAS BACnet Stack Example - B-LD"
    },
